rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/289482152/616646330-a31eb647-fcd1-42c8-9416-5337d2216461.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODY4NTYzMTIsIm5iZiI6MTc4Njg1NjAxMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8yODk0ODIxNTIvNjE2NjQ2MzMwLWEzMWViNjQ3LWZjZDEtNDJjOC05NDE2LTUzMzdkMjIxNjQ2MS5wbmc_._9fqv_diT_uwWLkqP1thgAvCBXdkMjfcw2Cq0lSBmDg\"><img width=\"30%\" height=\"544\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/289482152/616646330-a31eb647-fcd1-42c8-9416-5337d2216461.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODY4NTYzMTIsIm5iZiI6MTc4Njg1NjAxMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8yODk0ODIxNTIvNjE2NjQ2MzMwLWEzMWViNjQ3LWZjZDEtNDJjOC05NDE2LTUzMzdkMjIxNjQ2MS5wbmc_._9fqv_diT_uwWLkqP1thgAvCBXdkMjfcw2Cq0lSBmDg\"></a> Figure 6 [PAM8403 footprint].\n<br>\n(Note that the PAM8403 used in this project is the \"knobby\" version of the PAM8403 amplifier board, which allows it to work as the volume control. Furthermore, note that the knobs on the PAM8403 and KY-040 modules are not included in their corresponding footprints for the ease of drawing the footprint and because the boards will not physically touch the PCB).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/289482152/616645217-386cddac-ef01-4aad-add5-2574a7bbf171.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODY4NTYzMTIsIm5iZiI6MTc4Njg1NjAxMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8yODk0ODIxNTIvNjE2NjQ1MjE3LTM4NmNkZGFjLWVmMDEtNGFhZC1hZGQ1LTI1NzRhN2JiZjE3MS5wbmc_.XMNvKMzUOHKR_znXkxKozvVaME94RBk1CCBBmlSnCXc\"><img width=\"30%\" height=\"601\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/289482152/616645217-386cddac-ef01-4aad-add5